    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλουτός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buttock</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. δεξιός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.66
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493a23
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.340
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.9
			</span></i>: dual, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ γλουτώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			: heterocl. pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλουτά, τά</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				6.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαίρωμα τῆς κοτύλης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Cf. Skt. <i>glaús</i> 'round lump', Engl.
				<i>clot.</i>)</div>
